ID,Date,Module,Defect,How found,Root cause,Severity,Status,Fix,Commit
D-01,2026-08-10,Module 1,Repeated letters produced phantom yellow tiles,Code review,"indexOf() always matched the first occurrence, so a repeated guess letter was flagged more times than it appears in the answer",High,Fixed,Rewritten as a two-pass WordleEngine,f2f08fa
D-02,2026-08-10,Module 1,Board rendered with zero rows,Unit test,"Kotlin property init order: attempts was declared after _uiState, so freshState() read 0",High,Fixed,Moved the declaration above _uiState,f2f08fa
D-03,2026-08-10,Module 1,Progress would strand past level 20,Code review,MAX_LEVEL hardcoded to 20 in UnlockManager and CompletedManager,Medium,Fixed,Driven from LevelProvider.levelCount,f2f08fa
D-04,2026-08-10,Backend,POST attempt failed on levels 21-27,Manual API test (curl),levels table only held 20 rows and attempts/unlocks have foreign keys to it,High,Fixed,Migration 002 seeds levels 21-27,f2f08fa
D-05,2026-08-10,Module 2,Replaying a solved dish awarded points and new badges,Play testing,"Gamification had no record of pre-Module-2 solves, so replays looked like new wins",High,Fixed,ensureSeeded plus a solvedLevels guard; failing test written first,039a5f9
D-06,2026-08-10,Module 2,Points displayed 0 after the replay fix,Play testing,Seeding claimed its flag but awarded no points and never evaluated badges,High,Fixed,Retroactive BASE_POINTS credit plus grantOwedBadges,7b16158
D-07,2026-08-10,Module 2,Same account showed different points on a second device,Play testing,No read path existed; the client only ever pushed progress,High,Fixed,get_progress.php plus a server-wins refresh,fba24b2
D-08,2026-08-12,Module 2,Dish count stuck at 0 until leaving and returning,Play testing,"remember(Session.userId) snapshotted prefs once, before the async sync landed",Medium,Fixed,Screens read the reactive gamification flow,b8d0cc5
D-09,2026-08-12,Module 2,Points spent on power-ups were refunded,Play testing,spendPoints wrote locally and never pushed; the server-wins refresh restored the old balance,High,Fixed,"Spending routed through GamificationCoordinator.spend, which debits and pushes",a09dd5a
D-10,2026-08-12,Module 1,Leaving a round discarded the board,Play testing,"Round state lived only in the ViewModel, which is cleared on navigation",Medium,Fixed,SavedRound plus RoundStateRepository persisted to SharedPreferences,a09dd5a
D-11,2026-08-12,Module 1,Back from the dish page replayed the win screen,Play testing,PROCEED pushed the dish page without removing the finished game destination,Medium,Fixed,Every exit pops the game entry; launchSingleTop on return,1d27d68
D-12,2026-08-12,Module 2 UI,Region panel covered the pin it described,Play testing,"Popup sat at the top of the map, exactly where the Luzon pin is",Low,Fixed,Progress and region detail share one slot below the map,50ecd6d
D-13,2026-08-12,Module 2 UI,Explore header scrolled under the status bar,Screenshot review,Header was inside the scrolling Column,Low,Fixed,Only the body scrolls now,9d74657
D-14,2026-08-12,Backend,"Any client could write any account: points, badges, profile",Security review,"Endpoints read user_id from the request body, so identity was a claim rather than a credential",Critical,Fixed,Bearer tokens; kk_require_user() derives identity and ignores the body user_id,901374d
D-15,2026-08-12,Backend,users.role missing though it is in the shared User contract,Schema review against the contract,Never added when the contract was agreed,Medium,Fixed,"Migration 004 adds role ENUM(player, admin)",901374d
D-16,2026-08-12,Mobile,Existing installs would 401 silently after the auth change,Migration review,Stored sessions predate tokens: a user_id with no way to authenticate it,Medium,Fixed,SessionStore treats a tokenless session as signed out,96392d4
D-17,2026-08-12,Backend,post_attempt / post_unlock / get_unlocks / get_profile_stats still accept a spoofed user_id,Security review,Left open deliberately because the ASP.NET dashboard calls them and would start failing,High,OPEN,Needs KusinaApiClient.cs to send a token first — coordinate with the Module 5 owner,—
D-18,2026-08-17,Mobile,Raw exception text shown to the player on a failed login,Play testing,"Errors were surfaced as e.message, so Ktor's ""Connect timeout has expired [url=http://192.168.100.21/...]"" went straight to the screen in red",Medium,Fixed,"AppError classification plus an ErrorNotice component; raw text moved behind a Details toggle",4739727
D-19,2026-08-17,Mobile,App cannot reach the server after changing network,Play testing,"KusinaApi.BASE is a hard-coded LAN IP (192.168.100.21), so it only works on the network the server sits on",High,OPEN,"Interim: make the base URL configurable at runtime. Real fix: the Azure host in Module 6 cloud integration",—
D-20,2026-08-17,Backend,Password reset OTP returned in the API response — full account takeover,Security review,"$APP_DEBUG was hard-coded true in request_password_reset.php, so anyone who knew an email could read the reset code from the JSON and change that password",Critical,Fixed,"Off by default via KK_EXPOSE_RESET_CODE, and additionally refused unless the caller is on localhost",88d481c
D-21,2026-08-17,Backend,No rate limiting or lockout on login or OTP verification,Security review,"Nothing counted failed attempts, so passwords and 6-digit reset codes could be guessed without limit",High,Fixed,"auth_attempts table; throttled per identifier and per IP, before any account lookup so lockout is not an enumeration oracle",88d481c
D-22,2026-08-17,Backend,Register confirmed which email addresses have accounts,Security review,"""Username or email already registered"" turned sign-up into an account checker",Medium,Fixed,"Username collisions still reported plainly (public on the leaderboard); email collisions get a generic refusal",88d481c
D-23,2026-08-17,Backend,Database internals returned to clients,Security review,"Four endpoints echoed 'PDO: ' . getMessage(), naming tables and columns",Low,Fixed,kk_fail() logs the real error server-side and returns a generic message,88d481c
D-24,2026-08-17,Mobile,Bearer token recoverable via ADB backup and readable on a rooted device,Security review,"android:allowBackup was true and the token sat in plain SharedPreferences",Medium,Fixed,"allowBackup=false; EncryptedSharedPreferences with a Keystore-backed key, migrating any existing plaintext session",88d481c
D-25,2026-08-17,Backend,Signing out left the token valid for its full 30 days,Security review,"Logout only cleared the device copy; nothing revoked it server-side, so a captured token kept working",Medium,Fixed,logout.php revokes the calling token (or all sessions with ?all=1); the app calls it on sign-out,88d481c
D-26,2026-08-17,Admin Dashboard,Every ranked player shows Bronze — Gold and Silver are unreachable,Code review during the web Clean Architecture refactor,"Tier thresholds are Gold>=2000 / Silver>=1000, but the dashboard passes a count of correct attempts, which across 27 dishes tops out in the dozens (highest in the live DB is 35). The thresholds suit the mobile points scale, where that same player has 2375.",Medium,OPEN,"Behaviour preserved and pinned by tests in KusinaKode.Domain.Tests. Fix is a team decision: rescale the thresholds to the attempt count, or feed the dashboard the mobile points instead.",—
D-27,2026-08-24,Backend / Mobile,Solving a new dish did not add +10 KK (wallet stayed at daily 5),Play testing,"+10 depended on post_progress seeing rounds_completed go up. A first solve of Lechon (level 1) was often already in CompletedManager so it looked like a replay and never minted. Now the first correct attempt for a dish mints +10 via post_attempt.php.",High,Fixed,First correct attempt per level_id fires round_win +10; client settles the tx_ref before refreshing the wallet,—
